# Runtime toolchain gate — policy for scripts/check-runtime-toolchain.py
# (Odoo #1975; ADR-0044 §2.2 + Amendment 2026-11-12).
#
# mode report   findings are ::warning:: lines and a summary row; the bake stays
#               green. The 1.6 line runs in this mode (Manager, 2026-11-12).
# mode enforce  an unallowlisted toolchain, or an expired entry that still
#               matches, aborts the bake. Switch here as the first BOSv1.7 item,
#               after one real rc bake reported exactly the two entries below.
#
# allow <image> <until YYYY-MM-DD> <#odoo-ticket> <reason>
#   <image> = the repository's last path segment (e.g. home-assistant-armv7),
#   exact match. Every entry is time-boxed and names the ticket that removes it.
#   An expired entry that still matches FAILS in enforce mode, as a lapsed
#   add-on pin hold does.
mode report

